        "content": "ABANDONED CART RECOVERY — 3-EMAIL AI SEQUENCE\n\nTRIGGER: Fires when a Shopify checkout is created.\nThe workflow waits, checks if the customer bought,\nthen sends AI-personalized emails only if they didn't.\n\nSEQUENCE:\n→ 1 hour after checkout → Email 1: Friendly reminder\n→ 24 hours after Email 1 → Email 2: Value + mild urgency\n→ 48 hours after Email 2 → Email 3: 10% discount, final offer\n\nSTOP CONDITIONS:\nBefore each email, the workflow checks if the customer\nalready placed a paid order. If yes — sequence stops.\nNo unwanted emails to people who already bought.\n\nAI ENGINE: Mistral generates personalized copy using\nthe customer's name and specific products from their cart.\n\nDISCOUNT CODES: Unique per customer (COMEBACK10-XXXXXX)\nCreated live in Shopify via API before Email 3 sends.\n\nBEFORE ACTIVATING — replace all placeholders:\n→ REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_STORE.myshopify.com\n   (your Shopify store domain)\n→ REPLACE_WITH_SHOPIFY_ACCESS_TOKEN\n   (Admin API access token from Shopify Partners)\n→ REPLACE_WITH_SHOPIFY_CREDENTIAL_ID\n   (your Shopify credential ID in n8n)\n→ REPLACE_WITH_MISTRAL_CREDENTIAL_ID\n   (your Mistral Cloud credential ID in n8n)\n→ REPLACE_WITH_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID\n   (your Gmail credential ID in n8n)\n→ REPLACE_WITH_SHEETS_CREDENTIAL_ID\n   (your Google Sheets credential ID in n8n)\n→ REPLACE_WITH_CART_LOG_SPREADSHEET_ID\n   (create a Google Sheet with these columns:\n   Timestamp | Customer Email | Customer Name |\n   Products | Cart Total | Email Sent | Discount Code | Status)",
        "height": 600,
